765 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (are also significant contributors to trafficking. Gender inequality is rampant with female children being perceived as burdens to the family. A lack of awareness about the problem contributes to its persistence \(Alam, 2022\). )
/Pg 31 0 R
