/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Victims of human trafficking endure severe trauma before, during, and after their exploitation. The psychological effects are long-lasting, often manifesting as complex post-traumatic stress disorder \(C-PTSD\), depression, anxiety, and dissociative disorders. Trauma )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [16 17]
>>
endobj
