801 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Victims of sexual assault experience post-traumatic mental challenges, acute stress disorders, depression and other psychological issues . Women often suffer from sleep disorders, nightmares, anxiety, depression, suicidal ideation, and diminishing of sexual urge and pleasure amongst other disorders following sexual assault or rape. Recovery is slower in sexual than in non-sexual assault victims. Factors influencing recovery are emotional support from friends, relationships, social and community support. Overall social changes in outlook and perception towards women are needed in modern society to curb the sexual assault on women.)
/Pg 33 0 R
>>
endobj
