1052 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (and health professionals were incorporated as subthemes within managing and coping. Additional themes addressing recovery, future help-seeking, and adaptation of recovery-focused therapy were retained following a deductive approach.)
/E (and health professionals were incorporated as subthemes within managing and coping. Additional themes addressing recovery, future help-seeking, and adaptation of recovery-focused therapy were retained following a deductive approach.)
/Pg 48 0 R
