/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A distinctive feature of the ATTUNE research agenda is its emphasis on creative and expressive modalities, such as dance, visual arts, and digital storytelling, as both therapeutic tools and epistemic resources. These methods are theorised to facilitate emotional expression, social connection, and reflective processing in ways that are accessible to adolescents with diverse cognitive and linguistic profiles.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
